Sawisé sukses ning &lt;a href="Bollywood"&gt;Bollywood&lt;/a&gt;, Khan dadi panata cara ning acara MANO YA NA MANO lan KYAA KAHEIN.
Taun 2008, Khan main dadi inspektur pulisi ning filem kang judhulé SLUMDOG MILLIONAIRE amarga filem mau, dhèwèké
dadi pamenang Scren Actors Guild Award dadi Outstanding Performance saka Motion Picture.
