Theloderma corticale

Theloderma corticale kodhok &lt;a href="lumut"&gt;lumut&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Vietnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;, ya iku &lt;a href="sp%C3%A9sies"&gt;spésies&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kodhok"&gt;kodhok&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="kulawarga"&gt;kulawarga&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Rhacophoridae"&gt;Rhacophoridae&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Kodhog"&gt;Kodhog&lt;/a&gt; iki tinemu &lt;a href="Vietnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cina"&gt;Cina&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Habitat"&gt;Habitat&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="alam"&gt;alam&lt;/a&gt;e &lt;a href="subtropis"&gt;subtropis&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="alas"&gt;alas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="dataran"&gt;dataran&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="cendh%C3%A8k"&gt;cendhèk&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="tropis"&gt;tropis&lt;/a&gt; kang &lt;a href="lembab"&gt;lembab&lt;/a&gt;, urip ing &lt;a href="banyu"&gt;banyu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="tawar"&gt;tawar&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="laladan"&gt;laladan&lt;/a&gt; wewatu. Jeneng umum saka &lt;a href="kodhok"&gt;kodhok&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="lumut"&gt;lumut&lt;/a&gt; kawiwitan saka kasunyatan yèn &lt;a href="kulit"&gt;kulit&lt;/a&gt;e duwé bintik-bintik &lt;a href="ijo"&gt;ijo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="ireng"&gt;ireng&lt;/a&gt; kaya le&lt;a href="lumut"&gt;lumut&lt;/a&gt;an kang urip ing watu, lan wujudé kang efektif kamuflase utawa panyamaran.
<h2>Deskripsi</h2>
Deskripsi.
Jeneng &lt;a href="kodhok"&gt;kodhok&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="lumut"&gt;lumut&lt;/a&gt; iki kawiwitan saka anané kasunyatan yèn &lt;a href="kulit"&gt;kulit&lt;/a&gt; saka kodhok duwé warna &lt;a href="ijo"&gt;ijo&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="lurik"&gt;lurik&lt;/a&gt;-lurik lan &lt;a href="coklat"&gt;coklat&lt;/a&gt; kang kaya &lt;a href="lumut"&gt;lumut&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="urip"&gt;urip&lt;/a&gt; ing dhuwur &lt;a href="watu"&gt;watu&lt;/a&gt;. Kodhok-kodhok mau duwé bantalan pliket kang gedhé padha &lt;a href="sikil"&gt;sikil&lt;/a&gt;e lan &lt;a href="weteng"&gt;weteng&lt;/a&gt;e kang alus. Kaya &lt;a href="kodhok"&gt;kodhok&lt;/a&gt;-kodhok &lt;a href="wit"&gt;wit&lt;/a&gt; liyané, padha karo &lt;a href="kodhok"&gt;kodhok&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="wadon"&gt;wadon&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="jinis"&gt;jinis&lt;/a&gt; iki ngrembakane luwih gedhé tinimbang &lt;a href="kodhok"&gt;kodhok&lt;/a&gt; lanang. Nalika kodhok iki ngrembaka, gedhene awak bisa ngancik 7–8&amp;nbsp;cm. Kodhok &lt;a href="lumut"&gt;lumut&lt;/a&gt; iki ya iku panganane &lt;a href="gegremet"&gt;gegremet&lt;/a&gt; kaya ta &lt;a href="jangkrik"&gt;jangkrik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="walang"&gt;walang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="coro"&gt;coro&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="cacing"&gt;cacing&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="laler"&gt;laler&lt;/a&gt;.
