<doc id="79062" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=79062" title="Sundarbans">
Sundarbans

(Shundorbôn) The Sundarbans ya iku &lt;a href="muara"&gt;muara&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="alas"&gt;alas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="bako"&gt;bako&lt;/a&gt; kang gedhé dhéwé ing &lt;a href="donya"&gt;donya&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku, Sundarbans uga minangka sawijining Taman kang dadi panggonan pelestarian &lt;a href="macan"&gt;macan&lt;/a&gt; lan tuwuhan &lt;a href="biosfer"&gt;biosfer&lt;/a&gt;. Taman iki dumunung ing &lt;a href="delta"&gt;delta&lt;/a&gt; Sundarbans ing &lt;a href="nagara"&gt;nagara&lt;/a&gt; pérangan &lt;a href="Bangladesh"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Divisi%20Khulna"&gt;Divisi Khulna&lt;/a&gt;. Wewengkon iki minangka wewengkon kang padhet amarga ditutupi déning &lt;a href="alas"&gt;alas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="mangrove"&gt;mangrove&lt;/a&gt;, lan minangka salah siji cadangan kang gedhé dhéwé tumrap &lt;a href="macan%20Benggala"&gt;macan Benggala&lt;/a&gt;. Iki uga dadi omah tumrap pirang-pirang &lt;a href="manuk"&gt;manuk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sp%C3%A9sies"&gt;spésies&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="reptil"&gt;reptil&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="inv%C3%A8rtebrata"&gt;invèrtebrata&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu &lt;a href="baya"&gt;baya&lt;/a&gt; banyu &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;.
Sekitar rong puluh jinis saka seket enem jinis &lt;a href="mangrove"&gt;mangrove&lt;/a&gt; kang tinemu ing &lt;a href="donya"&gt;donya&lt;/a&gt;, urip apik ing Sundarbans &lt;a href="Vegetasi"&gt;Vegetasi&lt;/a&gt; mangrove iki lumrahé diidentifikasekake ing &lt;a href="alas%20campuran"&gt;alas campuran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="alas%20bako"&gt;alas bako&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="alas%20pasisir"&gt;alas pasisir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="alas%20udan%20teles"&gt;alas udan teles&lt;/a&gt; lan alas suket &lt;a href="alluvial"&gt;alluvial&lt;/a&gt;. Déné &lt;a href="kali"&gt;kali&lt;/a&gt; ing Sundarbans ya iku panggonan panemone &lt;a href="banyu%20asin"&gt;banyu asin&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="banyu%20tawar"&gt;banyu tawar&lt;/a&gt;. Mula wewengkon mau minangka wewengkon transisi antarané banyu tawar saka kali-kali kang asalé saka Kali &lt;a href="Gangga"&gt;Gangga&lt;/a&gt; lan banyu tawar saka &lt;a href="Teluk%20Benggala"&gt;Teluk Benggala&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Vegetasi"&gt;Vegetasi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="mangrove"&gt;mangrove&lt;/a&gt; mbantu pambentuke daratan anayr lan vegetasi iku mainake peran wigati ing &lt;a href="morfologi"&gt;morfologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="rawa"&gt;rawa&lt;/a&gt;. Kegiyatan tuwuhan mangrove iki bisa ngrembakake fitur &lt;a href="mikromorfologi"&gt;mikromorfologi&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nyipta substrat &lt;a href="bibit"&gt;bibit&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="mangrove"&gt;mangrove&lt;/a&gt;. Morfologi lan &lt;a href="evolusi"&gt;evolusi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="bukit%20eolian"&gt;bukit eolian&lt;/a&gt; dikendalekake déning tuwuhan &lt;a href="xerophytic"&gt;xerophytic&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="halophytic"&gt;halophytic&lt;/a&gt;.
