Salim Segaf Al-Jufri (#ALIH). Salim Segaf Al-Jufri iku &lt;a href="Mantri%20Sosial%20R%C3%A9publik%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Mantri Sosial&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; 2009-2014. Sadurungé dadi mantri, Salim Segaf Al-Jufri dadi &lt;a href="Duta%20Besar%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Duta Besar Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="Arab%20Saudi"&gt;Arab Saudi&lt;/a&gt; lan Kesultanan &lt;a href="Oman"&gt;Oman&lt;/a&gt; wiwit sasi &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;. Salim nggenténi &lt;a href="Muhammad%20Maftuch%20Basyuni"&gt;Muhammad Maftuch Basyuni&lt;/a&gt; kang wis dadi &lt;a href="Mantri%20Agama"&gt;Mantri Agama&lt;/a&gt; Salim Segaf Al-Jufri uga tau njabat dadi Ketua Dewan Syariah Parté Keadilan Sejahtera (PKS), Direktur Perwakilan WAMY (World Assembly of Muslim Youth) kanggo Kawasan &lt;a href="Asia%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Asia Wétan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Asia%20Tenggara"&gt;Asia Tenggara&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku, Salim uga tau dadi Direktur Syariah Consulting Center.
Salim uga aktif mulang ing &lt;a href="UIN%20Syarif%20Hidayatullah"&gt;UIN Syarif Hidayatullah&lt;/a&gt;, Lembaga Ilmu Pengetahuan Islam lan &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Basa Arab&lt;/a&gt; (LIPIA) lan Dirasat Islamiyah &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;.
Salim Segaf Al Jufri iku putuné ulama gedhé ing &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Palu"&gt;Palu&lt;/a&gt;. Ulama iki jenengé &lt;a href="Sayyid%20Idrus%20bin%20Salim%20Aljufrie"&gt;Sayyid Idrus bin Salim Aljufrie&lt;/a&gt; utawa kondhang kanthi jeneng Guru Tua. Ulama iki kang nggawé yayasan &lt;a href="Al-Khairaat"&gt;Al-Khairaat&lt;/a&gt;.
