<doc id="79177" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=79177" title="Reginald Fessenden">
Reginald Fessenden

Reginald Aubrey Fessenden (#ALIH) ya iku salah siji sakapirang-pirang wong kang duwé jasa ing donya &lt;a href="teknologi"&gt;teknologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="radio"&gt;radio&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké dadi salah siji &lt;a href="panemu"&gt;panemu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="radio"&gt;radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ahli"&gt;ahli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="fisika"&gt;fisika&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="insinyur"&gt;insinyur&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="guru"&gt;guru&lt;/a&gt; besar &lt;a href="ng%C3%A8lmu"&gt;ngèlmu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="fisika"&gt;fisika&lt;/a&gt;. Fessenden lair tanggal &lt;a href="6%20Oktober"&gt;6 Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1866"&gt;1866&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Bolton"&gt;Bolton&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Wétan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Quebec"&gt;Quebec&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké wis kasil gawé 500 &lt;a href="penemon"&gt;penemon&lt;/a&gt;, ing antarané ya iku &lt;a href="alternator"&gt;alternator&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="detektor"&gt;detektor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="heterodin"&gt;heterodin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="fathometer"&gt;fathometer&lt;/a&gt;, lan penggerak &lt;a href="turbo%20listrik"&gt;turbo listrik&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="kapal"&gt;kapal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="tempur"&gt;tempur&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Alternator"&gt;Alternator&lt;/a&gt; ya iku piranti kanggo ngonekake &lt;a href="listrik"&gt;listrik&lt;/a&gt; lan ngasilaké &lt;a href="arus"&gt;arus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="bolak%20balik"&gt;bolak balik&lt;/a&gt;. Kanti anané &lt;a href="alternator"&gt;alternator&lt;/a&gt; wis nyurung anané &lt;a href="radio"&gt;radio&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="telepon"&gt;telepon&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Detektor"&gt;Detektor&lt;/a&gt; ya iku &lt;a href="piranti"&gt;piranti&lt;/a&gt; kanggo ngowahi arus bolak balik dadi &lt;a href="arus"&gt;arus&lt;/a&gt; kang &lt;a href="searah"&gt;searah&lt;/a&gt;. Déné, &lt;a href="Heterodin"&gt;Heterodin&lt;/a&gt; ya iku piranti kanggo ngowahi &lt;a href="frekuensi"&gt;frekuensi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="radio"&gt;radio&lt;/a&gt; mula &lt;a href="frekuensi"&gt;frekuensi&lt;/a&gt; mau gampang diatur lan bisa dikuwatake.
