<doc id="79225" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=79225" title="Takeda Shingen">
Takeda Shingen

Takeda Shingen (武田 信玄, Takeda Shingen)(&lt;a href="1%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;1 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1521"&gt;1521&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="3%20November"&gt;3 November&lt;/a&gt; taun pisanan ana ing era &lt;a href="Daiei"&gt;Daiei&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="13%20M%C3%A8i"&gt;13 Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1573"&gt;1573&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="12%20April"&gt;12 April&lt;/a&gt; taun angka 14 era &lt;a href="Genki"&gt;Genki&lt;/a&gt;) utawa dikenal karo Takeda Harunobu yaiku &lt;a href="daimyo"&gt;daimyo&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="jaman%20Sengoku"&gt;jaman Sengoku&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="provinsi%20Kai"&gt;provinsi Kai&lt;/a&gt;. Takeda Shingen lair dadi putra kang sah kanggo marisi &lt;a href="klan%20Takeda"&gt;klan Takeda&lt;/a&gt; kang turun temurun njabat &lt;a href="shugo"&gt;shugo&lt;/a&gt; ana ing &lt;a href="Kai"&gt;Kai&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé bisa nguwasani &lt;a href="provinsi%20Shinano"&gt;Shinano&lt;/a&gt;, Takeda Shingen banjur tarung nglawan &lt;a href="Uesugi%20Kenshin"&gt;Uesugi Kenshin&lt;/a&gt; ana ing &lt;a href="Pertempuran%20Kawanakajima"&gt;Pertempuran Kawanakajima&lt;/a&gt;. Takeda Shingen terus ngambakake wewengkon kakuasane nganti tekan provinsi Kai, Shinano, &lt;a href="provinsi%20Suruga"&gt;Suruga&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="provinsi%20Kozuke"&gt;Kōzuke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="provinsi%20Totomi"&gt;Tōtōmi&lt;/a&gt;, lan uga sapérangan wewengkon &lt;a href="provinsi%20Mikawa"&gt;Mikawa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="provinsi%20Mino"&gt;Mino&lt;/a&gt;. Takeda Shingen dikabarke mati amarga lara ana ing dalan nalika arep nyerang &lt;a href="Kyoto"&gt;Kyoto&lt;/a&gt;. Shingen yaiku sawijining jeneng &lt;a href="kaimyo"&gt;kaimyō&lt;/a&gt; dena Harunobu yaiku jeneng kaurmatan (&lt;a href="imina"&gt;imina&lt;/a&gt;). Jeneng resmi kang diwènèhake kaisar yaiku Minamoto no Harunobu. Ana ing peperangan, Takeda Shingen kang duwé jejuluk "&lt;a href="macan"&gt;macan&lt;/a&gt; saka Kai" ngibarake bendera perang kang dijenengi &lt;a href="F%C5%ABrinkazan"&gt;Fūrinkazan&lt;/a&gt; (風林火山, &lt;a href="F%C5%ABrinkazan"&gt;Fūrinkazan&lt;/a&gt; angin, rimba, geni, gunung). Pasukan numpak jaran kang dibawahi Takeda Shingen yaiku wadyabala kavaleri paling kuwat ana ing &lt;a href="jaman%20Sengoku"&gt;jaman Sengoku&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika jaman &lt;a href="Taisho"&gt;Taishō&lt;/a&gt;, Shingen kanthi anumerta nampa kalungguhan &lt;a href="Jusan-i"&gt;Jusan-i&lt;/a&gt; kang duwé kedudukan telung tingkat sangisore kalungguhan mahamantri.
Takeda Shingen lair tanggal &lt;a href="3%20November"&gt;3 November&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1521"&gt;1521&lt;/a&gt; kang dadi putra pewaris &lt;a href="Takeda%20Nobutora"&gt;Takeda Nobutora&lt;/a&gt; ing provinsi Kai. Tarō utawa Katsuchiyō yaiku jeneng undang-undangane nalika dhèwèké isih cilik. Bapaké Shingen (Takeda Nobutora) yaiku daimyō jaman Sengoku kang nyawijikake provinsi Kai lan uga kang ngadegaké klan Takeda. Nobutora yaiku pemimpin génerasi angka 18 klan &lt;a href="Kai%20Genji"&gt;Kai Genji&lt;/a&gt; utawa klan &lt;a href="Takeda"&gt;Takeda&lt;/a&gt; kang turun temurun njabat &lt;a href="shugo"&gt;shugo&lt;/a&gt; ing provinsi Kai wiwit &lt;a href="jaman%20Kamakura"&gt;jaman Kamakura&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika laire Shingen, provinsi Kai diserang déning 15.000 prajurit saka wadyabala Imagawa kang dibawahi &lt;a href="Fukushima%20Masanori"&gt;Fukushima Masanori&lt;/a&gt; saka panjalukan saka &lt;a href="Imagawa%20Ujichika"&gt;Imagawa Ujichika&lt;/a&gt;. Semangat tempur wadyabala Takeda dadi tambah semangat nalika ngerti berita kelairan Shingen, kang ndadèkaké wadyabala Imagawa kang jumlah luwih akèh bisa dikalahake.
