Milford Sound (Piopiotahi di Māori) ya iku sawijining panggonan plesiran kang paling misuwur ing &lt;a href="Niu%20Selan"&gt;Niu Selan&lt;/a&gt;, panggonan &lt;a href="wisata"&gt;wisata&lt;/a&gt; iki dumunung ing tlatah &lt;a href="Taman%20Nasional"&gt;Taman Nasional&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Fiordland"&gt;Fiordland&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Situs%20Warisan%20Donya"&gt;Situs Warisan Donya&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Te%20Wahipounamu"&gt;Te Wahipounamu&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Wiwitane Milford Sound disepelekaké déning penjelajah &lt;a href="%C3%89ropah"&gt;Éropah&lt;/a&gt;, amarga wektu iku wong-wonge lumebu ing &lt;a href="wewengkon"&gt;wewengkon&lt;/a&gt; iki arep ora bisa metu. Kapten &lt;a href="kapal"&gt;kapal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pelayaran"&gt;Pelayaran&lt;/a&gt; kaya ta &lt;a href="James%20Cook"&gt;James Cook&lt;/a&gt;, kang nglewati Milford Sound, uga wedi nyedhaki &lt;a href="lereng"&gt;lereng&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="gunung"&gt;gunung&lt;/a&gt; kang bebayani, wedi kaanan &lt;a href="angin"&gt;angin&lt;/a&gt; kang nimbulake &lt;a href="swara"&gt;swara&lt;/a&gt; banter.
