<doc id="79279" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=79279" title="Julius Robert Oppenheimer">
Julius Robert Oppenheimer

Julius Robert Oppenheimer (&lt;a href="1904"&gt;1904&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1967"&gt;1967&lt;/a&gt;) ditepungi minangka ahli &lt;a href="fisika"&gt;fisika&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Robert iku dadi salah sijiné tokoh &lt;a href="Proyek%20Manhattan"&gt;Proyek Manhattan&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="Perang%20Dunia%20II"&gt;Perang Dunia II&lt;/a&gt; kang duwé tugas kanggo nggawé &lt;a href="bom%20atom"&gt;bom atom&lt;/a&gt; kang sepisanan.
Julius Robert lair ing &lt;a href="New%20York%2C%20New%20York"&gt;New York, New York&lt;/a&gt; lan sinau ing &lt;a href="Harvard"&gt;Harvard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cambridge"&gt;Cambridge&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Goettingen"&gt;Goettingen&lt;/a&gt;. Julius Robert nampa gelar &lt;a href="Ph.D."&gt;Ph.D.&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt; kanthi bimbingan &lt;a href="Max%20Born"&gt;Max Born&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Gottingen"&gt;Gottingen&lt;/a&gt; kang nalika iku dadi pusat pengembangan &lt;a href="mekanika%20kuantum"&gt;mekanika kuantum&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé rong taun lulus, Julius Robert banjur yasa &lt;a href="sekolah"&gt;sekolah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="fisika%20teoretis"&gt;fisika teoretis&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Institut%20Teknologi%20California"&gt;Institut Teknologi California&lt;/a&gt; lan ing &lt;a href="Berkeley"&gt;Berkeley&lt;/a&gt;.
Julius Robert Oppenheimer akèh nyumbangaké pikiran ing babagan &lt;a href="fisika%20atom"&gt;fisika atom&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="fisika%20nuklir"&gt;nuklir&lt;/a&gt;. Julius Robert uga nemu &lt;a href="bintang"&gt;bintang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="neutron"&gt;neutron&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="nolongan%20ireng"&gt;nolongan ireng&lt;/a&gt; kang wis disepelekké &lt;a href="astronom"&gt;astronom&lt;/a&gt; ing wektu kapungkur.
Nalika &lt;a href="PD%20II"&gt;PD II&lt;/a&gt;, Oppenheimer mimpin program &lt;a href="bom%20atom"&gt;bom atom&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Los%20Alamos%2C%20New%20Mexico"&gt;Los Alamos, New Mexico&lt;/a&gt;, lan nalika taun &lt;a href="1947"&gt;1947&lt;/a&gt; Julius Robert dadi direktur Institute of Advanced Study ing &lt;a href="Princeton%2C%20New%20Jersey"&gt;Princeton, New Jersey&lt;/a&gt;. Oppenheimer duwé akèh mungsuh nalika bubar &lt;a href="perang"&gt;perang&lt;/a&gt;, awit Julius Robert kang ngusulaké pengendalian &lt;a href="%C3%A8nergi%20atom"&gt;ènergi atom&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="internasional"&gt;internasional&lt;/a&gt; lan nentang digawéné &lt;a href="bom%20hidrogen"&gt;bom hidrogen&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika taun &lt;a href="1954"&gt;1954&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Atomic%20Energy%20Commission"&gt;Atomic Energy Commission&lt;/a&gt; nerangake yèn Robert kalebu wong kang kudu diamanake.
