<doc id="79280" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=79280" title="Julius Axelrod">
Julius Axelrod

Julius Axelrod urip nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1912"&gt;1912&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;). Julius Axelrod iku salah sijiné &lt;a href="farmakolog"&gt;farmakolog&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="ahli%20saraf"&gt;ahli saraf&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kang tau éntuk &lt;a href="Penghargaan%20Nobel%20sajeroning%20Fisiologi%20utawa%20Kedhokteran"&gt;Penghargaan Nobel sajeroning Fisiologi utawa Kedhokteran&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;a href="Nobel"&gt;Nobel&lt;/a&gt; iki amarga panemuané ing aksi &lt;a href="neurotransmiter"&gt;neurotransmiter&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning ngatur metabolisme &lt;a href="sistem%20saraf"&gt;sistem saraf&lt;/a&gt;.
Julius Axelrod iku anak saka pasangan &lt;a href="Isadore%20Axelrod"&gt;Isadore Axelrod&lt;/a&gt; salah sijiné tukang nggawe &lt;a href="kranjang"&gt;kranjang&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Molly%20Liechtling%20Axelrod"&gt;Molly Liechtling Axelrod&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika taun &lt;a href="1929"&gt;1929&lt;/a&gt; Julius Axelrod lumebu ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20New%20York"&gt;Universitas New York&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="NYU"&gt;NYU&lt;/a&gt;). Sawisé iku, nalika taun &lt;a href="1930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt; Julius Axelrod banjur pindah ing &lt;a href="City%20College%20of%20New%20York"&gt;City College of New York&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="CCNY"&gt;CCNY&lt;/a&gt;). Ing Universitas iki, Julius Axelrod sinau babagan &lt;a href="sajarah"&gt;sajarah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="filsafat"&gt;filsafat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sastra"&gt;sastra&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="biologi"&gt;biologi&lt;/a&gt;. Julius Axelrod lulus kanthi gelar &lt;a href="S.Si."&gt;S.Si.&lt;/a&gt; ing babagan biologi saka CCNY. Julius Axelrod banjur dadi asisten &lt;a href="laboratorium"&gt;laboratorium&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Harriman%20Laboratory"&gt;Harriman Laboratory&lt;/a&gt;. Julius Axelrod kerja ing pérangan &lt;a href="Bakteriologi"&gt;Bakteriologi&lt;/a&gt;, Fakultas Kedhokteran &lt;a href="New%20York%20University"&gt;New York University&lt;/a&gt;. Julius Axelrod dadi &lt;a href="kimiawan"&gt;kimiawan&lt;/a&gt; inf &lt;a href="Laboratory%20of%20Industrial%20Hygiene"&gt;Laboratory of Industrial Hygiene&lt;/a&gt;, New York City Department of Health nalika taun &lt;a href="1935"&gt;1935&lt;/a&gt; nganti &lt;a href="1946"&gt;1946&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika taun &lt;a href="1938"&gt;1938&lt;/a&gt; Julius Axelrod nikah karo wong wadon kang jenengé &lt;a href="Sally%20Taub"&gt;Sally Taub&lt;/a&gt;. Saka pernikahané iki, Julius Axelrod nduwé anak kang cacahé loro.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1941"&gt;1941&lt;/a&gt;, Julius Axelrod nampa gelar &lt;a href="M.Sc."&gt;M.Sc.&lt;/a&gt; ing babagan &lt;a href="kimia"&gt;kimia&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="NYU"&gt;NYU&lt;/a&gt;. Gelar iki ditampa sawisé Julius Axelrod nglakoni pendhidhikan &lt;a href="pascasarjana"&gt;pascasarjana&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé iku Julius Axelrod banjur dadi kolega peneliti karo &lt;a href="Bernard%20B.%20Brodie"&gt;Bernard B. Brodie&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Goldwater%20Memorial%20Hospital"&gt;Goldwater Memorial Hospital&lt;/a&gt; kang manggon ing &lt;a href="Welfare%20Island%2C%20New%20York"&gt;Welfare Island, New York&lt;/a&gt;.
Julius Axelrod banjur pindhah ing &lt;a href="National%20Heart%20Institute"&gt;National Heart Institute&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="NHI"&gt;NHI&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="National%20Institutes%20of%20Health"&gt;National Institutes of Health&lt;/a&gt; lan terus kerja karo Brodie nganti taun &lt;a href="1954"&gt;1954&lt;/a&gt;.
Nanging taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, Julius Axelrod mati ing omahé kang manggon ing &lt;a href="Rockville%2C%20Maryland"&gt;Rockville, Maryland&lt;/a&gt;.
