<h2>Samosir sajrone pambageyan distrik ing HKBP</h2>
Samosir sajrone pambageyan distrik ing HKBP.
&lt;a href="Huria%20Kristen%20Batak%20Prot%C3%A8stan"&gt;Huria Kristen Batak Protèstan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="HKBP"&gt;(HKBP)&lt;/a&gt; kapérang ing akèh &lt;a href="distrik"&gt;distrik&lt;/a&gt; kang kabawah karo &lt;a href="pendeta%20distrik"&gt;pendeta distrik&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="praeses"&gt;praeses&lt;/a&gt;). Pambagéyan distrik iki wis ana wiwit taun &lt;a href="1911"&gt;1911&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika iku, Samosir wis dadi salah sijiné distrik ing &lt;a href="HKBP"&gt;HKBP&lt;/a&gt; kang dadi siji karo &lt;a href="Toba"&gt;Toba&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku &lt;a href="Distrik%20IV%20Toba%20Samosir"&gt;Distrik IV Toba Samosir&lt;/a&gt;.
Sawisé ngrembakané &lt;a href="Distrik%20IV%20Toba%20Samosir"&gt;Distrik IV Toba Samosir&lt;/a&gt;, Samosir uga dipisah saka Distrik IV Toba Samosir nalika tanggal &lt;a href="25"&gt;25&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="November"&gt;November&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1945"&gt;1945&lt;/a&gt; lan dadi &lt;a href="Distrik%20VII%20Samosir"&gt;Distrik VII Samosir&lt;/a&gt;. Distrik IV Toba Samosir iki ganti jeneng dadi &lt;a href="Distrik%20IV%20Toba"&gt;Distrik IV Toba&lt;/a&gt;.
Nganti sasi Dhésèmber 2008 iki, rekapitulasi &lt;a href="ressort"&gt;ressort&lt;/a&gt; ing Distrik VII Samosir ana 22 &lt;a href="gr%C3%A9ja"&gt;gréja&lt;/a&gt; ressort lan 106 gedhong gréja HKBP. Distrik VII Samosir iki duwé laladan ing &lt;a href="Palipi"&gt;Palipi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nainggolan"&gt;Nainggolan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ambarita"&gt;Ambarita&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Harianboho"&gt;Harianboho&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Onan%20Runggu"&gt;Onan Runggu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Simanindo"&gt;Simanindo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sianjurmulamula"&gt;Sianjurmulamula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tomok"&gt;Tomok&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lumban%20Suhisuhi"&gt;Lumban Suhisuhi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ronggurnihuta"&gt;Ronggurnihuta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pusuk%20Buhit"&gt;Pusuk Buhit&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pangururan"&gt;Pangururan&lt;/a&gt;, lan sakupenge.
