Nabe kang isiné manéka warna jinis daging, lan padatan minangka panganane &lt;a href="sumo"&gt;sumo&lt;/a&gt;
<li>&lt;a href="Sukiyaki"&gt;Sukiyaki&lt;/a&gt;</li>
Nabe kang isiné daging sapi.
<li>Botan nabe</li>
Nabe kang isiné daging &lt;a href="c%C3%A8l%C3%A8ng"&gt;cèlèng&lt;/a&gt;.
<li>Motsu nabe</li>
Nabe kang isiné &lt;a href="jeroan"&gt;jeroan&lt;/a&gt;.
<li>Tetchiri</li>
Nabe kang isiné &lt;a href="iwak"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="fugu"&gt;fugu&lt;/a&gt;.
