Restu Sinaga (#ALIH). Restu Sinaga iku salah sijiné bintang &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Restu miwiti karir nalika dhèwèké dadi &lt;a href="modhel"&gt;modhel&lt;/a&gt;. Film kang tau dibintangi Restu Sinaga nganti saiki ya iku &lt;a href="Cinta%20Silver"&gt;Cinta Silver&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;. Ing filem iki, Restu main karo &lt;a href="Luna%20Maya"&gt;Luna Maya&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cathrine%20Wilson"&gt;Cathrine Wilson&lt;/a&gt;. Film liyané ya iku filem kang nduwéni genre horor ya iku Missing bareng karo &lt;a href="Endhita"&gt;Endhita&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Annisa%20Tribanowati"&gt;Annisa Tribanowati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Inong"&gt;Inong&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sultan%20Djorgi"&gt;Sultan Djorgi&lt;/a&gt;. Film produksi &lt;a href="PT%20Kharisma%20Starvision"&gt;PT Kharisma Starvision&lt;/a&gt; iki milih lagu Akhir Dunia kang dinyanyekaké karo &lt;a href="Padi%20%28grup%20musik%29"&gt;Padi&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; Restu dadi bintang ing filem &lt;a href="I%20Love%20You%2C%20Om"&gt;I Love You, Om&lt;/a&gt;, arahan sutradara &lt;a href="Widi%20Wijaya"&gt;Widi Wijaya&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku Restu dadi pemeran pembantu ing filem &lt;a href="Koper"&gt;Koper&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt; Restu bareng karo &lt;a href="Nova%20Eliza"&gt;Nova Eliza&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Julia%20Perez"&gt;Julia Perez&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Al%20Fathir%20Muchtar"&gt;Al Fathir Muchtar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Olga%20Syahputra"&gt;Olga Syahputra&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tio%20Pakusadewo"&gt;Tio Pakusadewo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Emmie%20Lemu"&gt;Emmie Lemu&lt;/a&gt; main ing filem Susahnya Jadi Perawan.
Restu uga tau njajal main teater kanthi main ing pertunjukan teater &lt;a href="Nyai%20Ontosoroh"&gt;Nyai Ontosoroh&lt;/a&gt; kang dianakake ing &lt;a href="Gedung%20Graha%20Bhakti%20Budaya"&gt;Gedung Graha Bhakti Budaya&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Taman%20Ismail%20Marzuki"&gt;TIM&lt;/a&gt; Jakarta tanggal &lt;a href="12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="13"&gt;13&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="14"&gt;14&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Agustus"&gt;Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;. Pertunjukan iki asil adhaptasi saka &lt;a href="nov%C3%A8l"&gt;novèl&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bumi%20Manusia"&gt;Bumi Manusia&lt;/a&gt; karyané novelis misuwur ing Indonesia ya iku &lt;a href="Pramoedya%20Ananta%20Toer"&gt;Pramoedya Ananta Toer&lt;/a&gt;. Ing &lt;a href="teater"&gt;teater&lt;/a&gt; iki, Restu main bareng karo &lt;a href="Nuansa%20Ayu"&gt;Nuansa Ayu&lt;/a&gt; (Sanikem)&lt;a href="Williem%20Bivers"&gt;Williem Bivers&lt;/a&gt; (Tuan Mellema), &lt;a href="Temmy%20Mellianto"&gt;Temmy Mellianto&lt;/a&gt; (Minke), Madina Wowor (Annelies), Hendra Yan (Ir. Mauritsz), Teuku R. Wikana (Robert Suhrof), Fellencia (Maiko), Harrist (Babah Ah Tjong), &lt;a href="Joind%20Bayuwinanda"&gt;Joind Bayuwinanda&lt;/a&gt; (Bupati Brojonegoro), Bowo GP (Sastro Tomo), Pipien Putri (istri Sastro Tomo), Budi Ketjil (Darsam), Ayu Diah Pasha (Bunda Minke), &lt;a href="Ayes%20Kassar"&gt;Ayes Kassar&lt;/a&gt; (Jean Marrais) Sita RSD (Magda Peters), Rebecca Hensckhe, Rusman, lan Rudi Wowor. Restu Sinaga main dadi tokoh &lt;a href="Robert%20Mellema"&gt;Robert Mellema&lt;/a&gt; ing teater iki.
Saliyané main filem lan teater, Restu uga duwé usaha biro désain interior, Ad Living nalika taun &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;.
Restu uga dipilih dadi main filem kang temané &lt;a href="Facebook"&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;.
