<doc id="79695" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=79695" title="Pirates of the Caribbean: At World's End">
Pirates of the Caribbean: At World's End

Pirates of the Caribbean: At World's End iku pérangan katelu saka trilogi &lt;a href="Pirates%20of%20the%20Caribbean"&gt;Pirates of the Caribbean&lt;/a&gt;. At World's End disutradarai déning &lt;a href="Gore%20Verbinski"&gt;Gore Verbinski&lt;/a&gt;, kang uga dadi sutradara ing rong filem sadurungé. Pemain-juru main yang ana ya iku &lt;a href="Johnny%20Depp"&gt;Johnny Depp&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Keira%20Knightley"&gt;Keira Knightley&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Orlando%20Bloom"&gt;Orlando Bloom&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bill%20Nighy"&gt;Bill Nighy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Geoffrey%20Rush"&gt;Geoffrey Rush&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Jack%20Davenport"&gt;Jack Davenport&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané juru main-juru main iku, uga ana &lt;a href="Chow%20Yun-Fat"&gt;Chow Yun-Fat&lt;/a&gt; kang main dadi Sao Feng, mungsuh anyar ing trilogi iki. Film iki bakalan dibabarake ing tanggal &lt;a href="25%20M%C3%A8i"&gt;25 Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing pungkasan carita Dead Man's Chest, &lt;a href="Will%20Turner"&gt;Will Turner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Elizabeth%20Swann"&gt;Elizabeth Swann&lt;/a&gt;, lan kru &lt;a href="kapal"&gt;kapal&lt;/a&gt; Black Pearl kang isih ana éntuk bantuan saka &lt;a href="Tia%20Dalma"&gt;Tia Dalma&lt;/a&gt;, kang banjur nawarake kesempatan kanggo nylametake Kapten &lt;a href="Jack%20Sparrow"&gt;Jack Sparrow&lt;/a&gt; saka ngisor sagara (ing carita sadurungé, Jack katangkep déning Kraken lan digawa menyang kuburan sagara). nanging, miturut Tia, bakalan angèl banget tanpa kapten kang bisa ngerteni kaanan sagara ing pucuking donya (World's End). Tia akhire ngenalake &lt;a href="Kapten%20Barbossa"&gt;Kapten Barbossa&lt;/a&gt;, kru Black Pearl kang mberontak lan ngangkat awake dhèwèké dadi kapten ing filem kang pisanan. Will lan Elizabeth kaget amarga sasuwéné iki dhèwèké nyana yèn kapten Barbossa wis mati ing tangane Jack Sparrow.
Tia Dalma, kang bisa nguripake Barbossa manèh sawisé dhèwèké dipateni ing filem pisanan, nulungi dhèwèké kanggo nylametake Sparrow. Dhèwèké banjur gawé tim kanggo nylametake kapten Jack Sparrow (lan banjur Bootstrap Bill Turner) lan ngalahake aliansi antarané Davy Jones, Cutler Beckett, lan Admiral James Norrington. Kacaritakake Jack Sparrow sikape mungsuhan karo Barbossa sanajan dhèwèké wis bersekuthu. Kaya kang dikutip saka sutradara Gore Verbinski, "Piracy itself is at stake. It's like the railroad coming to the West. There will be a conference of the world's pirate leaders and a treacherous journey to the literal 'worlds end'."
