<doc id="79743" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=79743" title="Salat awwabin">
Salat awwabin

Salat Awwabin iku siji jinis &lt;a href="salat%20Sunat"&gt;salat Sunat&lt;/a&gt;. Awwabin asal saka tembung &lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt; kang tegesé (wong kang kerep taubat). Ana prabédan panemut ngenani &lt;a href="salat"&gt;salat&lt;/a&gt; iki ing kalangan para &lt;a href="ulama"&gt;ulama&lt;/a&gt;. Ana kang mratélakaké yèn salat awwabin diayahi antara wektu &lt;a href="maghrib"&gt;maghrib&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="isya"&gt;isya&lt;/a&gt;, sauntara kang liya ngandhakaké salat awwabin iku jeneng liya saka &lt;a href="salat%20dhuha"&gt;salat dhuha&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Hadits kagandhèng</h2>
<ul>
<li>"Shalaté wong-wong awwabin (kang kerep taubat marang Allah) ya iku nalika anak unta ngrasa kepanasan" (HR. Muslim: 848)</li>
<li>"Ora ana kang njaga salat dhuha kajaba wong awwab (kerep taubat). Rasulullah ngendika: "Iku shalaté wong-wong kang kerep taubat" (HR Ibnu Khuzaimah sajeroning Shahihé: 1224, Al-Hakim sajeroning Al-Mustadrak 1/313 Ath Thabarani sajeroning Al-Ausath: 4322. Disahihaké Al Hakim lan disepakati Adz-Dzahabi. Lan dihasanaké Al-Albani sajeroning silsilah Ash-Shahihah no. 707).</li>
<li>Saka Zaid bin Arqam ra. Ngendika:" &lt;a href="Nabi%20SAW"&gt;Nabi SAW&lt;/a&gt; metu menyang kang ndunungi Quba lan wong-wong iku pinuju &lt;a href="salat%20dhuha"&gt;salat dhuha&lt;/a&gt;. Nabi ngendika,'Salat awwabin (duha‘) mungkasi nagnti panas nyengat (awani)' ". (HR Ahmad Muslim dan Tirmizy)</li>
</ul>
